//   primitive chooser, so we manually do helpers.cost := helpers.cost + 1 and
//   also steps := steps + 1. OpenConstrainedSpan, CloseConstrainedSpan, and
//   ConstrainedStep each bump helpers.cost internally, and each such branch also
